l accepted = v ?? false;\n                setState(() => _terms = accepted);\n                if (accepted) Analytics.capture('terms_accepted');\n              },\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"                  ? () => Navigator.of(context).pushNamed('/offers')\"\"\",\"\"\"                  ? () {\n                      Analytics.capture('registration_continue_tapped', {\n                        'amount': _amount.round(),\n                        'terms': _terms,\n                      });\n                      Navigator.of(context).pushNamed('/offers');\n                    }\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='lib/screens/offer_screen.dart'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"import 'package:flutter/material.dart';\\n\",\"import 'package:flutter/material.dart';\\n\\nimport '../analytics.dart';\\n\",1)\ns=s.replace(\"      body: ListView.builder(\",\"\"\"      // ScrollEndNotification: one event per scroll gesture, not per update.\n      body: NotificationListener<ScrollEndNotification>(\n        onNotification: (n) {\n          Analytics.capture('offers_scrolled', {'offset': n.metrics.pixels});\n          return false;\n        },\n        child: ListView.builder(\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"        },\n      ),\n    );\"\"\",\"\"\"        },\n        ),\n      ),\n    );\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nE\ndart format lib 2>&1|tail -2\ncat > ANSWER.md <<'E'\n# Analytics events\n\nImplemented all six events from `docs/EVENTS.md` through `Analytics.capture`, with the exact names and properties. No email or phone values are sent.\n\nRegistration screen:\n- `registration_email_started` / `registration_phone_started`: fire on the first edit only, behind `_emailStartedFired` / `_phoneStartedFired` flags. `onChanged` runs on every keystroke.\n- `loan_amount_changed` (`amount`): sent from the slider's `onChangeEnd`, so once per drag.\n- `terms_accepted`: sent only when the box is ticked, not when it is unticked.\n- `registration_continue_tapped` (`amount`, `terms`): sent on the Contin